WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.642
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:05.643 --> 00:00:08.416
What do they see?

3
00:00:08.417 --> 00:00:22.279
They see bumper cars!

4
00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:40.880
The blobs get into a car.

5
00:00:40.881 --> 00:00:45.612
The bumper car goes forward.

6
00:00:45.613 --> 00:00:53.106
Bump!

7
00:00:53.107 --> 00:00:58.222
The car goes backward.

8
00:00:58.223 --> 00:01:04.107
Bump!

9
00:01:04.108 --> 00:01:08.175
The car goes left.

10
00:01:08.176 --> 00:01:11.858
Bump!

11
00:01:11.859 --> 00:01:15.984
The car goes right.

12
00:01:15.985 --> 00:01:23.579
Bump!

13
00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:30.230
The car goes slow.

14
00:01:30.231 --> 00:01:34.509
Bump!

15
00:01:34.510 --> 00:01:37.794
The car goes fast.

16
00:01:37.795 --> 00:01:41.895
Bump!

17
00:01:41.896 --> 00:01:45.760
The car goes really fast!

18
00:01:45.761 --> 00:01:47.657
Vroom!

19
00:01:47.658 --> 00:01:52.657
Blobs, where are you going?

20
00:01:52.658 --> 00:01:55.455
Silly blobs!

21
00:01:55.456 --> 00:01:58.077
Good-bye!

